title: "Larena Licensing"
abstract: "Larena Licensing: Runtime licensing layer that decides which package, bundle and capability features are available to a site, with signed entitlement snapshots, trial restrictions, subscription/expiration policies, environment-aware licenses, limits and explainable locks."
